Are you looking for a job? Would you like to find out more about life in Poland? Download the Careers in Poland app, created by Poland’s largest recruitment website for foreigners. Apply for jobs,  browse employer profiles and learn all there is to know about the relevant legal regulations!

Download the app to:
-	apply for jobs dedicated to foreigners in Poland;
-	find out more about companies searching for foreign employees in Poland;
-	read about Polish customs, culture and traditions;
-	get more information on the Polish labour law;
-	learn about legal requirements related to the relocation process and your stay in Poland.

Get your Careers in Poland app to have all the necessary information at hand!
Feel free to share your feedback or suggestions at contact@careersinpoland.com.

With the Izola Saver Mobile app, you can manage your Saver account(s) on the go. Our app is user-friendly, fast and safe and provides you with the following functions:

• A secure and simple logon process;
• An account overview screen to check your Izola Saver account balances;
• A mini statement page that provides you with the 11 most recent transactions on your Izola Saver account(s);
• Transfer funds out of your Izola Saver account(s) to your linked principal bank account;
• Transfer funds into your Izola Saver account(s) from your linked principal bank via SEPA direct debit;
• Possibility to open Saver+ (term deposit) accounts;
